#: scenario5:scenario5_7F9C6881_0D0B_448C_963B_E47E326BBE54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 012a4b8b0e912cba5c3849f563632aee666a46819604ed2b3b2506796c1f4641
#. default-sha256: 16988188454583b1895c9970274da01583f8c8a26429e46e5fc8c39579ffd6ee
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F9C6881_0D0B_448C_963B_E47E326BBE54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It had been a little under "
"two weeks since I had moved in with Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫与米歇尔在一起的生活，⟪k:13⟫已"
"经过去了十天左右。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A2B2C3A3_E67B_4632_A11A_A01A64AC1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b538b262e90d223468ff2109750537e06f6088ccf9ec6c5e569d79d40d95305
#. default-sha256: cdd1bc549919ee2d0d93b31edf041706b785f14b0b798821ef0441b53e9004dc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A2B2C3A3_E67B_4632_A11A_A01A64AC1CB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though we lived in the same house, we rarely saw each other."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说是「一起」，⟪k:1⟫但互相之间碰面的机会却寥寥无几——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2A965A44_8F80_40BF_A5E1_D86B24CE088C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14e74f936366c9c189652b171616b9369b42350f2bc1fd3cf3d3a0226473a3f0
#. default-sha256: e6e895c3e2a4b7943f7031a9b8e067946ad84c702924676ee6ce69a896a8689f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2A965A44_8F80_40BF_A5E1_D86B24CE088C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On unlucky days, I wouldn’t see him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫甚至有可能，⟪k:1⟫整整一天都瞧不见他的影子。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85E8BFB9_F381_4DD1_BD7C_4527A9E775B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5661998dde0ad0b1f98c79ab036bbbf62705c61be09f86761402424042c9461
#. default-sha256: a4face74aa64273ada37df1be69c4ad36a637962e73db32b018c777f9d53f553
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85E8BFB9_F381_4DD1_BD7C_4527A9E775B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure if he ate in his room or our schedules were simply misaligned, but we never "
"had any meals together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫用餐时间也被错开，⟪k:1⟫或许是他选择在自己的房间里解决了吧……我不是很确定。⟪k:2⟫但两人一次也没"
"有过同席用餐。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5BCFB35_20B8_4F12_9B50_57F5C20CAF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df977370493e76101ea5f129949a31f8e0ee33062e37976430870fc2a08d5267
#. default-sha256: 664f7dccb89ae0bbc8f664723730dc100df583869b9067b2539526a395e6c78b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5BCFB35_20B8_4F12_9B50_57F5C20CAF1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Perhaps he was deliberately avoiding me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说不定，⟪k:1⟫他是在刻意避免和我搭上关系。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CBF3FE2B_D765_47F6_BB1B_2ECF64E875C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef26697250f5ed73208fc78337c5223e3ca9b6b7d893b9316f0a9a0ac5ad6896
#. default-sha256: 9d1e89ea8c5cee2b91cc08aa1b9616c857fd76215620901416d641f1a261507c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CBF3FE2B_D765_47F6_BB1B_2ECF64E875C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That has to be it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我果然……⟪k:1⟫被他疏远了呢……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C1E720E_D5B5_4FCD_86BC_ACBADC321ACB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e66f48970ea6f39d3ee0fb92b47095680d9f6c395fbfa8c265ffa6993808c100
#. default-sha256: ac4d242bc80b7acfe7ee01d496d7597ea5e08c42b855a8ee58258b7207bd9e41
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C1E720E_D5B5_4FCD_86BC_ACBADC321ACB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know servant and master don’t usually eat at the same table,⟪k:1⟫but even so..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说在馆主和佣人的立场上，⟪k:1⟫我们是不能同席用餐的。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6CBD4980_1912_4BFE_B443_1D7A16551157
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5a3323bb7c356edb55e3252f76e6d1aaed7634d29215fd190fbbea0833dc12f
#. default-sha256: 8c31f5003d6fbc22b484c725ec3cf36cd2c356e7b91a541208af8963579a1c07
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6CBD4980_1912_4BFE_B443_1D7A16551157"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He could be a little less obvious about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但……⟪k:1⟫也用不着如此明显地表露出拒人千里的架势。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EA9C66EA_A57E_400D_A70B_91B4F80816DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EA9C66EA_A57E_400D_A70B_91B4F80816DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5B8E17F4_A3C4_419A_A00C_994A0502EBCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf02caad16c940304e0640292baf503b420059f8a3485cb643ec983fedd6e231
#. default-sha256: 5149f55b2add658578ad1d1aa82edb7ff39d6f85dd69d7b22f59222258664563
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5B8E17F4_A3C4_419A_A00C_994A0502EBCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Am I really that much of a nuisance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫难道我就那么招人烦吗……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA276AAF_86AF_4D04_9849_50FCA2D525C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fefb4c2001229a50889f33f2602419e9d733a28b4893eb51c183e61d21e406ab
#. default-sha256: be9de99d4357c79a6e31a3fb92016247c547e081081bc9eda67de1d4575b7dce
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA276AAF_86AF_4D04_9849_50FCA2D525C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m not doing anything inappropriate, am I?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m being pleasant and sociable, aren’t "
"I?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我没做错什么事吧……？⟪k:1⟫一直都表现得挺开朗啊？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DF3F6E2A_FF8E_4D95_805F_7A18C50830D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: baf3562302d89e021b755299e3d317b648190b88b4ebebe917f4b5935aace043
#. default-sha256: 6167ffba96ab50eb7b559bc9d3157f3f654004a7e6947efe750aa747b40db3a9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DF3F6E2A_FF8E_4D95_805F_7A18C50830D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I haven’t given him any reason to not like me, I think.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hope..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫应该没有理由会招致反感吧…………⟪k:1⟫我是这么想的，但是……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C945864B_F126_41CF_AB15_A799D69A1064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddd4dde7fae7fa3c880c7e6e107ebd7705f58c4a65b22ca1bad8ed02bd63520f
#. default-sha256: 7abbefc9c287ad475a9734356f63d8073ca58ae1820d99211260394b61805067
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C945864B_F126_41CF_AB15_A799D69A1064"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had never been very enthusiastic about my staying here,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫确实，⟪k:1⟫最初得知我要留在这里时，⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫他就表现出不快的神情。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BA31EB28_082D_47A3_BB1A_CF08485A11A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 417f2352d0387664f5cea761e35533bef222a435e8eb47f5d2ea55bad2c4891a
#. default-sha256: 21803e0845c29d09b5d6152734a35eeb29161cea12f65b241212b91a6a1cd0ed
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BA31EB28_082D_47A3_BB1A_CF08485A11A3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but I hadn’t been given a choice. ⟪k:1⟫I had been sent here by his family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫我之所以会来这里——⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫也是被他本家所强迫的……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_285A114B_CE40_48E8_A101_D05970835748
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7250ba6764a6ac7301540d699213351c035fe26d303fd3f9429facf44140ad43
#. default-sha256: 9e8f4dd645f037baa99727c4d58bb4cdfb580c0b6c281afdb8a1869e5c8208ff
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_285A114B_CE40_48E8_A101_D05970835748"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Besides..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫而且………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8A74422A_EB14_4C1B_9C52_8A4D968F7929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8A74422A_EB14_4C1B_9C52_8A4D968F7929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1e150c3686cf2789db6376b1089cdbb2b554b0fad77b6cda30d7f1320a0c540
#. default-sha256: 312e29de767dfb2aeb462585bc1f03750308a714e9c1a13fe7ce42a46bd9c16f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A5ABC44B_1465_43F4_850E_1343EF233D08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No. Out with the negative thoughts. ⟪k:1⟫Gotta stay positive.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yeah! He hasn’t tried "
"to chase me out yet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不行不行，不能那么消极地思考。⟪k:1⟫必须积极地向前看。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫对了！⟪k:4⟫我也没有被喝令被逐"
"出馆嘛。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c122fefc2165f3de3abdf2bf14535315666347cf2769296b563c1732b11f8a4b
#. default-sha256: b0994322bb0bbc0c7741dbebce94565451d08c3dff82a51bd3e788c7005b67fb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_51CB0B3F_6BE5_4FF3_8496_E69F74237C28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just... ⟪k:1⟫haven’t broken the ice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以……⟪k:1⟫不过是还没有好好沟通罢了。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d4617ca5132d7a07c43cf13be2ee026a31fe881f861ce3d7271ec9d73f044e3
#. default-sha256: df7e5718254ff479b7d94257743a56f55669219647964502ae01ec610d485800
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F0A004FE_0504_4874_863A_BDC4B1385474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had to stay positive. ⟪k:1⟫Optimistic. ⟪k:2⟫Happy thoughts. ⟪k:3⟫And be myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……没错。⟪k:1⟫要积极一点，⟪k:2⟫不提起干劲可不行。⟪k:3⟫积极，⟪k:4⟫再积极一点。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫保持自"
"我，⟪k:7⟫再开朗一些。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 231b5dadc01b2376198697db5745b677f4c5f2bb9a78cd984133f7d99a0c9f9f
#. default-sha256: 029c1be7c77ee5aa400556e3a0859f9ce4c80ed0b6a377a170df339aae0d888e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_17E15F6A_C5C3_484C_AD9B_E119F8B8A747"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As long as I kept working at it, with enough time, Michel would surely come around and not "
"be so distant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫只要多花点时间，⟪k:1⟫就算是米歇尔，也应该能和我正常交流。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫所以说，⟪k:4⟫不努力可不"
"行……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2403580866f82c80ac6d7b01cbb773a9746a7d36a5d7450e5567051eec6a497
#. default-sha256: ba916aaa6685273ad6cbff82307a6aba3e9d8d1e5f9e65d22f7f00c16f558058
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_53CFEAC8_81FA_438F_89DC_E760DAC769D9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve got a goal, so let’s get to work!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First, I make supper, then I ask him to have "
"it with me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫既然如此的话！⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫等准备好晚餐……⟪k:3⟫干脆试着邀请他一起用餐吧！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f406c2d0216a6c36acf0956e40897f5c014b1ba17ff009a65b64428d1803a4f9
#. default-sha256: 5ea3976650c48a2c8f358dfb09ca948f17d53d13a95ebbe0a0e5eaebe6562d49
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7BF7B634_FCB5_4F5B_AF9C_9DD60B9B5647"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Gotta be proactive when it comes to the reclusive types.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All right, here goes!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对付那种忧郁型的人，⟪k:1⟫不能犹犹豫豫裹足不前。⟪k:2⟫好！⟪k:3⟫要和他好好相处！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ff81920ce642659d6a3adecb112adf7b04a06d85321e56ad3cdcd3180a11e5e
#. default-sha256: b5b0ca2ed7aaea8dd7f75140ccf3b55afa46658ca403483df28d69c1dbaacae4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1833A9EF_9C5F_42E2_A025_321232DDA47F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Or, here ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ go..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………话虽如此。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06868c5427ec3865e00316fc47f8c77d4523115a7a4fd4a5d67b20199451f691
#. default-sha256: d72272a2e8ece4936cf4c3d331dc55dbc6c8f60f0a768b8cb3eb38d8afacd9bb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B72CDCC4_4A01_424F_85BE_6835A62DB5E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but we’re almost out of supplies."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫食物却差不多要见底了。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23e88a9145692989f55e50a01f0420bed9963330369bd1c79fca785fe0c0a96e
#. default-sha256: 4422674a7d0c76d4fc7d63bc4a9ba2eec19889f293f19e3319328e0a6acca0ac
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_11BB8136_F92F_4ACC_9734_9C23776BACCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, so much for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………真头疼。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd309b62b77a801bee3c6c2a0c002d020e42353a4641dac1d0b97a99f0684a68
#. default-sha256: 328f94d394057555cb94ead93627772c9610e7621e739c8e2235eeb6ac8c6fa0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_412A536C_C679_4625_A4B3_6C6F04C86EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where the nonperishable food was stored. ⟪k:1⟫Dried foods, smoked meats, "
"cheeses, and a small scattering of root vegetables."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫地下室的仓库储存着耐存的食品。⟪k:1⟫像是熏肉、⟪k:2⟫干货、⟪k:3⟫奶酪之类的。⟪k:4⟫还有少许的根"
"菜。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76111bdbe3d9f5f89514d5a575ff92b9748146b7dead584897966bd3d6abad01
#. default-sha256: 2df84160f199a6eb53eb24d75e08fe954686e4e02ffd98f088acd7a0ac8361a9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C7595F5B_95E2_4441_AEA9_5031309B1B90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Looking at this makes me feel like a soldier holding down a castle’s fortifications."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就像守城士兵一样生活艰苦朴素呢。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DFC7153C_F91F_4BF4_8171_C97CFDF5C923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
